{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Mafioso\u2019s Dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mafioso\u2019s Dice throws you into a deadly table. As one of four mafia members, you\u2019ll fight to survive in this dark and dangerous game. Everyone knows the same truth: <strong>Only one will make it out alive\u2026 the rest will become memories.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>High-Stakes Dice Gameplay</strong><br>Roll the dice to gather points, manage your risks, and hit the target of <strong>1230 points</strong>. Once you do, the game shifts\u2014now it\u2019s not just about the dice, but courage and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/a17f156091f22f4f88093d89f7041c3a.poster.avif?t=1759920541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/a17f156091f22f4f88093d89f7041c3a.webm?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/a17f156091f22f4f88093d89f7041c3a.mp4?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Russian Roulette Mechanic</strong><br>The player who reaches 1230 chooses a target and pulls the trigger. If the chamber holds a bullet, it\u2019s game over for that player. But fate doesn\u2019t always go as planned\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/380af9acea6e7b9ad10ddfbff69d4821.poster.avif?t=1759920541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/380af9acea6e7b9ad10ddfbff69d4821.webm?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/380af9acea6e7b9ad10ddfbff69d4821.mp4?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>The Cards Change Everything!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about luck anymore \u2014 it\u2019s about reading minds.<br>The new card system brings bluffing, twists, and hilarious chaos to every round.<br>Use cards to deceive your opponents, flip the odds, or turn the table in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every draw is a chance to surprise, outsmart, and laugh your way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Shield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if a bullet hits you, you\u2019ll survive this round!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks the <strong>first</strong> bullet, then breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works against Knife and Dual Bullet shots too.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b Dual Bullet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot two different targets in the same round! Deadly advantage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire at two players back-to-back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bullet is resolved separately \u2014 can break Shields.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Knife</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point the gun at yourself by mistake!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shooter must target <strong>themselves</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not even a Shield can save you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Spy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peek at one of your opponent\u2019s cards!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly reveals one card from a player\u2019s hand.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.poster.avif?t=1759920541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.webm?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.mp4?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategy, Bluffing &amp; Mind Games</strong><br>Fate Cards mean the game isn't just about dice and bullets. With hidden powers, bluffing, threatening, and building (or breaking) trust are key tactics at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd74\ufe0f <strong>Stylized Mafia-Themed Atmosphere</strong><br>Dark, smoky, and retro\u2014a noir mafia world brought to life. Eye contact, silent deals, and dramatic finales define the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>4-Player Online Co-op Thriller</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651780?t=1759920541","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/5136a1a923b8524151ee1972e76b4b722b978105/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759920541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/290c0add0aa2c961e8d99590c81ffbb2fd0c9893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759920541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/290c0add0aa2c961e8d99590c81ffbb2fd0c9893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759920541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains stylized depictions of violence. Players engage in Russian roulette to eliminate each other, featuring dramatic gunshot sounds, a tense atmosphere, and elimination animations. There is no realistic blood or graphic violence.\r\nThe game does not include sexual content, drug use, or self-harm. Alcohol may be visually represented in the environment (e.g., bottles on the table) as part of the thematic setting. The game takes place in a dark, mature-themed mafia world."},"demos":[{"appid":3759630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Mafioso\u2019s Dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mafioso\u2019s Dice throws you into a deadly table. As one of four mafia members, you\u2019ll fight to survive in this dark and dangerous game. Everyone knows the same truth: <strong>Only one will make it out alive\u2026 the rest will become memories.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>High-Stakes Dice Gameplay</strong><br>Roll the dice to gather points, manage your risks, and hit the target of <strong>1230 points</strong>. Once you do, the game shifts\u2014now it\u2019s not just about the dice, but courage and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/a17f156091f22f4f88093d89f7041c3a.poster.avif?t=1759920541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/a17f156091f22f4f88093d89f7041c3a.webm?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co