ifferent targets in the same round! Deadly advantage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire at two players back-to-back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each bullet is resolved separately \u2014 can break Shields.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Knife</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point the gun at yourself by mistake!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shooter must target <strong>themselves</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not even a Shield can save you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Spy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peek at one of your opponent\u2019s cards!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly reveals one card from a player\u2019s hand.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.poster.avif?t=1759920541\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.webm?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651780/extras/e66b98bf127681b3af1fae63a9d61671.mp4?t=1759920541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Strategy, Bluffing &amp; Mind Games</strong><br>Fate Cards mean the game isn't just about dice and bullets. With hidden powers, bluffing, threatening, and building (or breaking) trust are key tactics at the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd74\ufe0f <strong>Stylized Mafia-Themed Atmosphere</strong><br>Dark, smoky, and retro\u2014a noir mafia world brought to life. Eye contact, silent deals, and dramatic finales define the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_parag